Significance: patch
Type: fix

Importing a file made elsewhere is safer for users who may not post unfiltered HTML (a site admin on a network): templates, template parts and widgets from the file go through the same HTML filter as other content, custom CSS needs the right to edit CSS, Advanced Custom Fields items need ACF's own capability and never bring PHP callbacks, an existing page keeps its Elementor design unless the import updates existing items, and a malformed source address in the file never rewrites links.
